  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Best Practices in Global Data Collection on Trafficking in Persons: The Science (and Art) of Understanding Trafficking in Persons</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The NEXUS Institute is strengthening evidence-based efforts to combat trafficking by providing state-of-the-art research about best practices in data collection, especially about trafficking victims and victim protection, as well as traffickers and the criminal justice response. The NEXUS Institute will develop evidence-based reports and practical guidelines for governments, NGOs, and other stakeholders based on this research.</narrative>
  </description>
